+## Chat on GitHub Pages (no install)
+
+`index.html` at the repository root is a standalone chat app. It runs entirely in the
+browser and needs no server.
+
+1. Push this repository to GitHub.
+2. Go to **Settings → Pages**, choose **Deploy from a branch**, select `main` and `/ (root)`, and save.
+3. Open the Pages URL. The setup wizard asks you to:
+   - pick a provider (Anthropic, OpenAI, xAI, Google Gemini, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint),
+   - paste your API key,
+   - pick a model from the list the provider returns.
+
+Your key and conversations are stored in this browser's `localStorage` only. Nothing is
+sent anywhere except directly to the provider you chose. Anyone who can use this browser
+profile can read the key, so don't use the page on shared computers. Use a key with a
+spending limit.
+
